
ZENTRO - COMPLETE SOCIAL APP
Documentation v1.0
Author: Clinton Ofomukoro
Founder & CEO - ZENTRO
Oghara, Delta State, Nigeria


1. OVERVIEW
ZENTRO is a certified 8-in-1 social platform for real people, meaningful connections.
Features: Home Feed, Discover, Matches, Messages, Profile, Videos, Communities, Live & Audio, Stories, Notifications, Settings, Saved Posts, Announcements, Help & Safety, Founder Dashboard, Blue Tick Verification, Dark Mode, PWA.

2. REQUIREMENTS
- Supabase account (FREE at supabase.com)
- Web hosting (Hostinger, cPanel, Vercel, Netlify)
- Modern browser
- No other dependencies

3. INSTALLATION - STEP BY STEP
STEP A: Supabase Setup (5 mins)
1. Go to https://supabase.com > Sign Up (Free)
2. Click New Project > Name: ZENTRO > Create password > Create Project (wait 2 mins)
3. Left Menu > SQL Editor > New Query
4. Open file database/supabase-setup.sql > Copy All > Paste in SQL Editor > Click RUN > Should show Success
5. Left Menu > Project Settings > API > Copy Project URL and anon/public key

STEP B: Configure App (2 mins)
1. Open index.html in Notepad / VS Code
2. Search (Ctrl+F) for SUPABASE_URL
3. Replace YOUR_SUPABASE_URL with your copied URL
4. Replace YOUR_SUPABASE_KEY with your anon key
5. Save file

STEP C: Deploy (2 mins)
- cPanel/Hostinger: File Manager > public_html > Upload all files
- Vercel: Go to vercel.com > New Project > Upload folder
- Netlify: app.netlify.com/drop > Drag folder > Get live link

STEP D: Test
Visit your domain > Create account > Create post > Test messages

4. FILE STRUCTURE
index.html - Main app
manifest.json - PWA config
service-worker.js - Offline support
icons/icon-192.png - 192x192 icon
icons/icon-512.png - 512x512 icon
database/supabase-setup.sql - Database schema (8 tables)
documentation/ZENTRO-Documentation.pdf - This file
README.txt - Quick start

5. CUSTOMIZATION
- Logo: Replace icons/icon-192.png and icon-512.png (keep same names)
- App Name: Change ZENTRO to your name in index.html and manifest.json
- Colors: In index.html search for #8B5CF6 and replace
- Founder: Search Clinton Ofomukoro and replace

